---
/* The container for ONE code snippet: a <pre class="code"> plus its optional
   <CodeCaption>, passed as children. The container owns all outer spacing and
   all compare-column flex behavior, so the caption's distance from the code
   box is identical everywhere (prose flow, list items, compare columns).
   Every pre.code in the guide lives inside one of these; never place a bare
   pre or a sibling caption directly in the page. */
---

<div class="snippet">
  <slot />
</div>
